[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899214221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106656#issuecomment-2899214221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106656","id":2899214221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6szn-N","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T20:57:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T20:59:07Z","body":"cc @Riteo \n\nCan you test this with native Wayland support enabled in the Project Settings?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd7bca9b-75e2-4aad-aac0-00b0036f9b35)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899214221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899448357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106656#issuecomment-2899448357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106656","id":2899448357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s0hIl","user":{"login":"jamie-pate","id":682658,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MjY1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/682658?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate","html_url":"https://github.com/jamie-pate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamie-pate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T22:56:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T23:00:50Z","body":"This only happens with `wayland` display server, not `X11` when running X11+wayland..\n\nTo get the correct 'system info' i had to run the editor with `--display-driver wayland` because it doesn't switch when you set the `Driver.linuxbsd` project setting.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899448357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899693960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106656#issuecomment-2899693960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106656","id":2899693960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6s1dGI","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-22T02:07:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-22T02:07:13Z","body":"Aight, it's my turn then :P\n\nAfter playing around with the MRP I think I know what's going on: you're using `_unhandled_input`, which is called only when you're interacting with the specific object the script is attached to (anything that isn't the buttons in this case). When the Wayland backend captures the pointer, it just locks it in place, which keeps the pointer on the button and thus never triggering `_unhandled_input` for the root object.\n\nAs a matter of fact switching to `_input` \"fixes\" the MRP, but it is obviously not ideal.\n\nI'll soon investigate what the X11 backend does when capturing the pointer and try to mimick it in the Wayland backend.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2899693960/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is